# AI assistant (otherwise-agent-panel)
app.agent.open = Assistant (⌘J)
app.agent.privacy = Your questions, the files you attach and the scan results the assistant reads (folder and file names, paths and sizes, your developer projects and their git state) go to {vendor} through your {agent}, with your own account. diskmap sends them to no one else and doesn't change your agent's settings. The assistant can only propose moving regenerable build folders and caches to the Trash: each proposal is a card you accept, and nothing is selected for you.
app.agent.privacy_ollama_remote = Your questions and the scan results the assistant reads (folder and file names, paths and sizes) go to the Ollama server at {host}.
